{"reviewId": "63390631_88Zh1Zr2S", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "今天是26年5月10日，美元/人民币汇率，人民币升值创4年新高6.796，约 38.4 万亿美元￼￼￼，美债利息今年可能突破1万亿美金，隔壁的日本更厉害，日债占GDP比率230%，是发达国家最高的，美国是125%，中国约 77%", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "13980-14073", "abstract": "要么美国衰退，从而中国和世界经济衰退，要么美元贬值而人民币继续升值。美国、中国和世界其余各国都不愿意世界经济衰退，从而会共同进行抵抗，那么，从中长期角度看，美元必然贬值，人民币必然升值。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "63390631_88Zh1Zr2S", "userVid": 63390631, "topics": [], "createTime": 1778374180, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 63390631, "name": "添喜佳宴", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0023-xGOMYSKrun1IvL_a2akWeda/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "添喜佳宴", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "Think Bold", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "未来，属于终身学习者", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-365", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 365}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 5, "likes": [{"userVid": 13724410, "name": "此山独姓", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/3hZfficKPGCoEozZpwgO1OaDNEePoPajF5PSiaYDD8VkcPDGrtsrh0yK6ia4ibC1cs3QBRxKEL2qPBbZD4Bs19mib8FPiaIK0LGgVqFJIBoKOC2hk/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "此山独姓", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "学术圈的小学生", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M5-0-100", "desc": "读完书籍", "title": "读完书籍", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComme